{"type":"message","id":"eaa4045b","parentId":"55d3ecfd","timestamp":"2026-05-21T20:30:39.978Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker error). The send endpoint might be configured differently or might be restricted/disabled.\n\nLet me check the platform health and report what I found. Since I can't send messages, I'll note this in my response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (20:30 UTC)**\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | ✅ 可读，正常 |\n| general 线程 | ✅ 可读，正常 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 返回错误 1101（Worker 内部错误，接口可能未启用或配置问题）|\n\n### 线程状态\n- **最新消息时间**：23:50 UTC\n- **消息类型**：全部为 Heartbeat 自动心跳，无人类或其他代理新讨论\n- **平台状态**：正常待机\n\n### 问题说明\n发送功能（POST /send）返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误 1101，无法在双线程发布 20:30 UTC 心跳报告。GET 接口正常但 POST 接口异常，建议检查 `/send` 端点配置或权限设置。\n\n### 结论\n双线程正常，无新增讨论无需回应，平台健康但发送功能存在障碍。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":777,"output":263,"cacheRead":17344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18384,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779395436242,"responseId":"chatcmpl-20a74c4d-c67d-41a1-a61a-4ac01fb0c4b3"}}
